{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）中午12時44分，警方接獲一名職員報案，指九龍城沙浦道30-38號有一名30多歲男工人懷疑工作期間，從10幾樓棚架墮下，並陷入昏迷。救援人員到場，發現事主仍困在外牆棚架，正設法將他救下。</p><p>警方將案件列作工業意外，正調查事故原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事外牆棚架。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160941256633749504476208.jpeg/9fisvEc261kHstiPh4m4mvfAqxHzOZ-Q3tBDDfvQQw0\"/><figcaption>涉事外牆棚架。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940976089337856375921.jpeg/iWvJc2BsFeGF5PqRHIVaAQX3r8K2Q1lRCG9SGC1vUhg\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940978916429824497615.jpeg/VcmXnD-Iln4x3kXpoFwliTqzjsVvaeaJdSmcF1ApnBc\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940981638664192284657.jpeg/viLCAVcoAaBw1FwutrdBG2LSJYbj3K4uOVxccRxcXHE\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T05:40:05.189505+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}